    videoClip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: c9b4dab26c7091c4ca50ce2fbd7ca7c9, type: 3}
  - name: MapOpenedTutorial
    description: Alright, I've been thinking. When life gives you lemons, don't make
      lemonade - make life take the lemons back! Get mad! I don't want your damn
      lemons, what am I supposed to do with these? Demand to see life's manager.
      Make life rue the day it thought it could give Cave Johnson lemons. Do you
      know who I am? I'm the man who's gonna burn your house down! With the lemons.
      I'm going to to get my engineers to invent a combustible lemon that burns your
      house down!
